# ── prepcli API (Cloudflare Worker) ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Only needed if you are self-hosting the Worker.
# Leave blank to use the official prepcli hosted backend — works out of the box.
# PREPCLI_API_URL=https://your-worker.your-account.workers.dev

# ── Self-hosting the Worker ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# If you deploy your own Worker, set these as Cloudflare Secrets (never here):
#   SUPABASE_URL        → wrangler secret put SUPABASE_URL
#   SUPABASE_ANON_KEY   → wrangler secret put SUPABASE_ANON_KEY
# See worker/README.md for full self-hosting instructions.
